{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/extras/7437ff6e5325c4075b2a08128ef22328.poster.avif?t=1762199539\" width=800 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/extras/7437ff6e5325c4075b2a08128ef22328.webm?t=1762199539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/extras/7437ff6e5325c4075b2a08128ef22328.mp4?t=1762199539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019ve been hired by an enigmatic millionaire obsessed with the impossible: to collect and preserve entities and objects originating from the Backrooms.\u00a0Your task is simple\u2026 yet deadly:\u00a0explore his private gallery, record anomalies, and expand the collection\u00a0\u2014 all while trying to keep your sanity\u2026 and your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/extras/4c2ce1a27fff2058b29dae67d9092e44.poster.avif?t=1762199539\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/extras/4c2ce1a27fff2058b29dae67d9092e44.webm?t=1762199539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/extras/4c2ce1a27fff2058b29dae67d9092e44.mp4?t=1762199539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each night, you\u2019ll be surrounded by entities and objects that you must analyze and stabilize according to their anomaly type \u2014 and their numbers will grow with every night you survive. With every inspection, you\u2019ll unlock new fragments of information in their respective logs, expanding the lore and uncovering the hidden stories behind each specimen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/extras/8f56d3b61e0380080c24cbefd694c5e8.avif?t=1762199539\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your next target from the work application, selecting based on your preferences or your survival needs. But be careful \u2014 one unrecorded anomaly could seal your fate\u2026 and make you end up just like your predecessors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/extras/16830af2c21ce5fdee1f09d8da1d5506.avif?t=1762199539\" width=1560 height=850 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you investigate, you\u2019ll face paranormal events, unpredictable scares, and a tense, oppressive atmosphere filled with dark humor and mystery. The gallery hides secrets that only the most persistent will uncover. Do you think you can survive long enough to fulfill the contract\u2026 or break it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Credits and Attributions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some models and sounds used in the trailer come from sources under Creative Commons licenses and are used with proper attribution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check the website to know more.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060180?t=1762199539","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060180?t=1762199539","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/28559d5e05820ded24dc008651417921ff301e2c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762199539","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060180/28559d